Excalibur is fine in my opinion.  As for the cloaks, I'm not sure I'd 
burn a wish on one when I have a perfectly ascendable cloak already.  The 
extra wish may be more useful than the cloak.


 
> Also, should I burn a wish on scrolls of charging or just write them
